    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="0629" n="549" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg549"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Russell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July 27,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 432.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 643, of the 14th instant, inclosing copy of your note to the Venezuelan
                    foreign office explaining the visit of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mayflower</hi> to Margarita Island, and a copy of the foreign office’s
                    reply.</p>
                <p>The incident appears thus to have been satisfactorily closed.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">David J. Hill</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
